{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n72\nIf our second government does not want to remain like\npeople who by bans and torrents of abuse try to cover up\ntheir confusion and the fact that they have allowed them-\nselves to be frightened by the Right, it will have to tell the\npeople a great deal about the \u201cconcealed counter-revolution-\naries\u201d  and  do  a  great  deal  to  combat  them  seriously.\nPravda  No.  79,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  24  (11),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "72", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "If our second government does not want to remain like", "x": 13.9, "y": 9.53, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "people who by bans and torrents of abuse try to cover up", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "their confusion and the fact that they have allowed them-", "x": 11.11, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "selves to be frightened by the Right, it will have to", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 70.06, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tell", "x": 81.63, "y": 15.34, "w": 4.98, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the", "x": 87.08, "y": 15.33, "w": 4.03, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "people a great deal about the \u201cconcealed counter-revolution-", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "aries\u201d  and", "x": 11.11, "y": 19.2, "w": 15.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "do", "x": 26.31, "y": 19.22, "w": 4.66, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a  great  deal  to  combat  them  seriously.", "x": 31.02, "y": 19.2, "w": 51.56, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 12.5, "y": 23.09, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 20.56, "y": 23.08, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "79", "x": 24.71, "y": 